      ],
      "message": "build: explicitly disable cl.exe\n\nSince 4f1e6de6, cmake for visual studio can only generate projects that\nuse clang-cl.\nBut calling cmake without '--preset windows' or '-T ClangCL' still\nsilently generates projects that cannot build anymore.\n\nExplicitly print a fatal error at cmake time if cl.exe is selected.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "bartoli",
        "email": "bartoli43@proton.me",
        "date": "2026-11-11T18:38:04Z"
